{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creators of <strong>STASIS</strong> and <strong>BONE TOTEM</strong> are taking you on a terrifying journey in <strong>ANIMAL USE PROTOCOL</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591790/extras/af60a277d2fea5ca1ec34afd6b126982.poster.avif?t=1759227868\" width=628 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591790/extras/af60a277d2fea5ca1ec34afd6b126982.webm?t=1759227868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591790/extras/af60a277d2fea5ca1ec34afd6b126982.mp4?t=1759227868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 3D first-person, narrative-focused survival horror game, you play as Penn, a hyper-intelligent chimpanzee leading the desperate escape of lab animals from a nightmarish facility, where every corner hides new terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591790/extras/0782813de5d3d0f74e8bc84bcad00d08.poster.avif?t=1759227868\" width=628 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591790/extras/0782813de5d3d0f74e8bc84bcad00d08.webm?t=1759227868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591790/extras/0782813de5d3d0f74e8bc84bcad00d08.mp4?t=1759227868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with <u>your wits</u>, a <u>gravity manipulation tool</u>, and accompanied by your <u>scrappy rat companion Trip</u>, you\u2019ll stealthily navigate the dystopian Anchorage Station, relentlessly stalked by a <i>monstrous chimera</i> of experiments gone wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591790/extras/6846ab669f698921a624f69abc7cd7f1.poster.avif?t=1759227868\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591790/extras/6846ab669f698921a624f69abc7cd7f1.webm?t=1759227868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591790/extras/6846ab669f698921a624f69abc7cd7f1.mp4?t=1759227868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind what happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be quick and quiet. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time is running out...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2591790?t=1759227868","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759227868","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591790/7a61593d1890015ecf8733384b4249b838f62ec5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759227868","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591790/7a61593d1890015ecf8733384b4249b838f62ec5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759227868","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}